## ObjectType: Position Valuation

Evidence-bearing valuation from trade-basis quantity, approved current price and dated FX. Missing, stale or unapproved prices block the value instead of producing zero.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| valuation_id | Valuation Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | valuation_id |
| position_id | Position Id | string | Foreign key to positions; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | position_id |
| price_id | Price Id | string | Foreign key to market_prices; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | price_id |
| fx_id | Fx Id | string | Foreign key to fx_rates; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | fx_id |
| as_of_date | As Of Date | date | Business snapshot date, distinct from quote/fixing date and date of knowledge. | as_of_date |
| valuation_status | Valuation Status | string | Explicit controlled state/reason; absence never implies completion or acceptance. Allowed values: blocked, complete. | valuation_status |
| reason | Reason | string | Explicit controlled state/reason; absence never implies completion or acceptance. Allowed values: missing, none, price_unapproved, stale. | reason |
| market_value_local | Market Value Local | decimal | Trade-basis quantity × price × factor, rounded 2dp in instrument currency; blank if price unusable. | market_value_local |
| market_value_base | Market Value Base | decimal | Rounded local value × same-snapshot FX, rounded 2dp USD; blank is unknown, not zero. | market_value_base |
| cost_value_base | Cost Value Base | decimal | Remaining booked local cost translated at current snapshot FX, 2dp USD; not historical FX cost. | cost_value_base |
| unrealized_pnl_base | Unrealized Pnl Base | decimal | USD market value minus USD cost translated at current FX, not total investment return or official NAV P&L. | unrealized_pnl_base |
| currency | Currency | string | Base currency USD; amounts are expressed in dollars. | currency |
| valuation_method | Valuation Method | string | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. Allowed values: bond_dirty, equity_mark. | valuation_method |
| view_kind | View Kind | string | actual is a synthetic observed fact; planned is an explicit forecast known at the observation date, never actual future completion. Allowed values: actual, planned. | view_kind |
| known_date | Known Date | date | Date this fact/assumption was available; actual facts cannot use future knowledge, planned assumptions are known by 2027-02-28. | known_date |

### Keys

Primary Keys: valuation_id
Display Key: valuation_id
